Package: owdata
Title: Index of openwashdata R Data Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lars", "Schöbitz", , "lschoebitz@ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2196-5015")),
    person("Global Health Engineering, ETH Zurich", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Ships a harvested catalog of the openwashdata R data
    packages, their datasets, and their variables. Provides accessor and
    search functions across the whole catalog, an installer that points at
    the openwashdata R-universe, and a refresh mechanism that fetches the
    latest published catalog without reinstalling the package. The catalog
    is regenerated weekly by an automated harvest of the openwashdata
    GitHub organization.
License: CC BY 4.0
URL: https://github.com/openwashdata/owdata,
    https://openwashdata.github.io/owdata/
BugReports: https://github.com/openwashdata/owdata/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    tibble,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    writexl
